From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Daniel=20Go=CC=81mez?= <26456472+HachebeDLC@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:56:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] iOS ports: the fork's six v0.7.2 commits, ported onto the
 1.0.2 engine

The port from the old v0.7.2 tree: Storm Connections / Sparking Zero / GL-NVN
fixes, Hades II 1080p+120, Kingdom Hearts multi-program support, the Vulkan
memory-leak fix, and the three profile keys (present_hz, display_height,
screen_percentage) moved to the runtime profile.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: carries the iOS ports the fork hosted on its ios-ports branch (Storm Connections / Sparking Zero bring-up, Hades II 1080p+120, KINGDOM HEARTS multi-program apps, the Vulkan movie-frame memory leak, three launcher settings as runtime-profile keys)
Issue: HachebeDLC/NX2Apple#1
